      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Henderson Harbor’s deep‑water port once hosted Olympic sailing trials, proving its nautical significance beyond local fishing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
